1. zlib — internal/zlib1
================================================================================

The package internal/zlib1 is an ALTERED Go port of the C zlib library's
compression level 1, specifically the deflate_fast path of deflate.c and the
Huffman coding of trees.c from zlib 1.2.13. It exists because the Absolute
Database engine writes its compressed internal files with C zlib at level 1,
and Go's compress/flate reproduces those bytes at no level.

It is a derivative work of zlib and is plainly marked as altered, as zlib's
licence requires. It is NOT zlib, has been rewritten in Go, implements only
level 1, and provides compression only. Any defect in it is this project's, not
zlib's. Report bugs here, never to the zlib authors.

